== 1. What ran
<1-what-ran>
- #strong[W1a]: the 12 frozen fixed-phase S4 inputs of the m83 matrix (seeds 260938 and 260939, 2 planted plus 4 natural per seed), 5 engines, 3 repetitions: 180 children.
- #strong[W1b]: the normal-subspace payload sweep s \= 2, 3, 4 (planted input 0 and natural input 2 per seed), 5 engines, 3 repetitions: 180 children.
- Per-child limits as in the m83 protocol: 1 GiB address space, 70 s wall kill, 25 s equation-build deadline, 5 s aggregate solver deadline, one benchmark process at a time. The host (4 cores, shared with other workers) had 1-minute load averages up to 2.317 at a W1a child start.
- Every completed cell reproduces the input hash, equation hash, complete algebraic root set and group verification of the same-repetition FES receipt (255 cells) and of the archived m83 receipt (246 cells); there are no mismatches (`results/verify_report.json`).

